an be fun, because I can be with you the whole time.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Niina's boyfriend in the real world, they go to the same school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He had no idea she was so into games."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38399"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69a75a2785538f729a3db2efb283b8f290ad4348558277356165d68bc43b09fd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fe7ab312dffe823db55f32a591ce56258c2b429aa525e52b213a51dc7089ee1.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"近藤 隆","creatorId":"vndb:s72","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s72","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s72","name":"近藤 隆","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:9136","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c38400","characterName":"アルヴァンド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c38400"},"originalCharacterName":"アルヴァンド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Now, please take my hand princess. Until you give me permission, I will wait forever.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Prince of the wealthy kingdom called the \"White Country\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A pure youth who has a strong sense of justice."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38400"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3ffbc8e6f0936a062f277034d1e992568e3491e052476946ff4f7ee8867688fa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e7/e7e515f720e410741e725f7ccf24d08bbdae98531a8f5d0e1e3abad625cde66a.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"武内 健","creatorId":"vndb:s486","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s486","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s486","name":"武内 健","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:9143","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c38401","characterName":"ラクロ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c38401"},"originalCharacterName":"ラクロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Is it alright to observe me so closely, it doesn't give you any benefit at all right?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attendant to the prince of the White Country."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a powerful magician."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38401"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c90ff7757e7ed98739f2170d27b8a41599e2ba0cf08e3d6a12c2a6f26f33daff.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9aa4d17ba8de14bf687f2f052e2066327ddcb8dcf3d5518723cddbb57351759a.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中井 和哉","creatorId":"vndb:s397","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s397","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s397","name":"中井 和哉","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:9142","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c38402","characterName":"ディセ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c38402"},"originalCharacterName":"ディセ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I see, you've finally understood-- That's good.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Prince of the kingdom that is advancing culture called the \"Black Country\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He believes his will is absolute and will not tolerate people who defy him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38402"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d347228f6e301f407035eb2a83a0cda3541f2d605374930e2aca637323843f36.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd3efe48833e8796cfddcb9b3a4a39776019b95370c54edcc24d6b7c126beb59.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神谷 浩史","creatorId":"vndb:s132","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s132","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s132","name":"神谷 浩史","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:9139","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c38404","characterName":"キース","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c38404"},"originalCharacterName":"キース","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Does the little miss also want to know... how adults play?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"On paper he's the prince of the Black Country's attendant, but he's really just a friend that follows him around everywhere."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His favorite weapon is his self-made gun."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38404"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/16efc9003bdc5ced4900592f654ca854a9a2878b1a2b10b893c54db8ff7aea31.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/